s_count": 30523, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/68b/68bcfe02c9b9b7123edab7ecce3f2660.jpg"}, {"id": 288, "name": "Interactive Fiction", "slug": "interactive-fiction", "language": "eng", "games_count": 5117, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/e0f/e0f8d58079f6a0c6afb25d91422a98fc.jpg"}, {"id": 45201, "name": "Remote Play Together", "slug": "remote-play-together", "language": "eng", "games_count": 4099, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/f72/f728954e667e580ba2ac507db226ae48.jpg"}, {"id": 46112, "name": "Shared/Split Screen Co-op", "slug": "sharedsplit-screen-co-op", "language": "eng", "games_count": 2652, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/355/355d2ec5d6b87518228dc30a9bb0e70d.jpg"}, {"id": 43374, "name": "Remote Play on TV", "slug": "remote-play-on-tv", "language": "eng", "games_count": 662, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/64e/64e2a77f37ddc48d102127234af99886.jpg"}], "publishers": [{"id": 69505, "name": "Entalto Publishing", "slug": "entalto-publishing", "games_count": 7, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/06a/06a48eea8260760040373319482eada1.jpg"}], "esrb_rating": {"id": 1, "name": "Everyone", "slug": "everyone"}, "clip": null, "description_raw": "INK INSIDE is the CO-OP beat-em-up RPG with the heart of a Saturday Morning Cartoon! Play as Stick (Brian David Gilbert) an unfinished doodle in an old notebook trying to discover who they are. Fight back against the wet \"Sog\" corrupting the world while saving your friends!\n\nFrom some of the minds behind Steven Universe: Unleash the Light, comes Ink Inside - a hand drawn adventure with the heart of a Saturday Morning Cartoon!\n\nPlay as Stick, an unfinished doodle trapped in a box of notebooks beneath a slowly leaking ceiling. As the water seeps into the notebooks, it warps the land around them and turns once friendly doodles into mindless, soggy monsters. Uncover lost memories and save your friends by battling back the waves of wetness corrupting the world\n\nFeaturing voices by Brian David Gilbert of YouTube & Dropout fame, and Deneen Melody from Evangelion and Netflix’s Romantic Killer.\n\nBattle enemies in action-packed dodgeball-meets-beat-em-up style combat that will see you dodging patterns of projectiles and chaining combos to escape a mushy fate.\n\nCollect new gear, unlock stronger abilities and fill your COOL MOVES bar to BREAK THE RULES and deal extra damage by smashing through the invisible wall protecting your enemies.\n\nComplete quests to uncover deep lore and explore sprawling, gorgeously illustrated worlds, from Fuzzball Forest to the Sugar Swamp.\n\nVisit shops to upgrade your gear, level up and mix and match new mechanics that will aid you on your epic quest to save the princess."}